# Repository Pattern for Data Access

Enforces repository pattern for all data access. Prevents direct Supabase calls in services and routes.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Accessing data (database, external APIs)
- Creating, reading, updating, deleting entities
- Need data access abstraction
- Writing services or routes

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable abstraction patterns

